{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 5774528176284778197,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Issue Links",
      "source_hash": 15645062779630835665,
      "context_hash": 8018854707799185720,
      "translation": "이슈 링크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920797Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Canonicalise Issue Links",
      "source_hash": 142922709479221255,
      "context_hash": 17698119600495049398,
      "translation": "이슈 링크 정규화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920798Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "GitHub permits having automatic action like `Fixes #123`, which closes the issue number `123`.",
      "source_hash": 6760256677359178279,
      "context_hash": 10144146317182697826,
      "translation": "GitHub에서는 `Fixes #123`과 같은 자동 동작을 사용할 수 있으며, 이 동작은 `123`번 이슈를 닫습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920798Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This handler updates the pull-request description with the canonicalized version, `Fixes org/repo#123`.",
      "source_hash": 5973714057075549180,
      "context_hash": 3811634075804164072,
      "translation": "이 핸들러는 풀 리퀘스트 설명을 정규화된 형태인 `Fixes org/repo#123`으로 갱신합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920798Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This is useful when updating subtrees into the upstream repository as it avoids referencing and closing the issue from the upstream repository instead of the one from the subtree.",
      "source_hash": 393318043320458360,
      "context_hash": 1677488124340315486,
      "translation": "이는 서브트리를 업스트림 저장소로 갱신할 때 유용합니다. 서브트리 쪽 이슈 대신 업스트림 저장소의 이슈를 참조하고 닫아 버리는 일을 막아 주기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈",
        "subtree": "서브트리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920799Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Issue Links in Commits",
      "source_hash": 10925122134515399483,
      "context_hash": 4826086002696250201,
      "translation": "커밋 내 이슈 링크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920799Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "GitHub also permits having issue links in commits which are then referenced in the issue.",
      "source_hash": 5582007091143682345,
      "context_hash": 8404057597850968411,
      "translation": "GitHub에서는 커밋에도 이슈 링크를 넣을 수 있으며, 이렇게 넣은 링크는 해당 이슈에 참조로 표시됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920799Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "While useful, they often more than anything else spam the referenced issue.",
      "source_hash": 9435880182674135004,
      "context_hash": 9555623333728603070,
      "translation": "유용하기는 하지만, 참조된 이슈를 스팸으로 도배하는 결과를 낳는 경우가 많습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920799Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "This handler puts a warning against them.",
      "source_hash": 1688776003673826066,
      "context_hash": 17438343223271122209,
      "translation": "이 핸들러는 이러한 링크에 대해 경고를 표시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920799Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 14569210066635490087,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920799Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled on a repository by having a `[issue-links]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 3979071211483052640,
      "context_hash": 6639925616372205422,
      "translation": "이 기능은 `triagebot.toml`에 `[issue-links]` 테이블을 추가하면 해당 저장소에서 활성화됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920799Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Without commits checking",
      "source_hash": 1892091642152427896,
      "context_hash": 12257016309750894904,
      "translation": "커밋 검사 없이 사용하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920799Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Some repositories may not need, or may prefer not, to warn about issue links in commit messages.",
      "source_hash": 13988852216149704773,
      "context_hash": 14425054468667561620,
      "translation": "일부 저장소에서는 커밋 메시지 내 이슈 링크에 대해 경고할 필요가 없거나, 경고하지 않는 편을 선호할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920799Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "This behavior can be disabled with the `check-commits` configuration option:",
      "source_hash": 14670121807662817233,
      "context_hash": 1940722151410508201,
      "translation": "이 동작은 `check-commits` 설정 옵션으로 비활성화할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920799Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Only check uncanonicalized issue links",
      "source_hash": 3989559479244415425,
      "context_hash": 17651024579470947553,
      "translation": "정규화되지 않은 이슈 링크만 검사하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920800Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "For subtrees (or embedded repositories), it is recommended to still check for *uncanonicalized* issue links (e.g. `#132` instead of `rust-lang/cargo#123`).",
      "source_hash": 13336757299274688443,
      "context_hash": 7750339635524934794,
      "translation": "서브트리(또는 내장된 저장소)의 경우, *정규화되지 않은* 이슈 링크(예: `rust-lang/cargo#123` 대신 `#132`)는 계속 검사할 것을 권장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920800Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "This prevents links from resolving to the wrong repository when the subtree is merged upstream while still allowing issue links in commits.",
      "source_hash": 18292558404990458429,
      "context_hash": 2376205271730511435,
      "translation": "이렇게 하면 커밋 내 이슈 링크는 계속 허용하면서도, 서브트리가 업스트림에 병합될 때 링크가 잘못된 저장소를 가리키는 일을 막을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈",
        "subtree": "서브트리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920800Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 1112944062745253243,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920800Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`src/handlers/issue_links.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/issue_links.rs) and [`src/handlers/check_commits/issue_links.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/check_commits/issue_links.rs).",
      "source_hash": 2785456424821127098,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/handlers/issue_links.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/issue_links.rs) 및 [`src/handlers/check_commits/issue_links.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/check_commits/issue_links.rs)를 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T04:45:06.920800Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}